HUMAN: Round 5 (effects polish) analysed — shockwave rings, saucer debris, foam-striping fix.
FIND F13 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:8644#"function spawnSaucerMissileExplosion(pos" what="big kills read flat — fire+smoke+sparks pools exist but no shockwave; kills lack punch" fix="add a pooled expanding shockwave ring: small pool (max 8) of camera-facing ring sprites (new ring texture via existing makeSpriteTexture-style canvas helper: radial ring, soft inner+outer falloff); on killShot explosions and player crash, emit 1 ring at pos: scale 2->55m over 0.55s, opacity 0.7->0, additive; NO new lights (invariant I5 — light-count groups must stay matched; use emissive sprite only)" ref=flight-sim3.html:8321-8341#"const muzzleFlashPool = new ParticlePool",flight-sim3.html:8014#"emitCluster(pos, count, spread" dep=-
FIND F14 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:8675#"impactBlastPool.emitCluster(pos" what="destroyed saucers vanish behind smoke — no debris" fix="pooled debris: ParticlePool-style but tiny meshes (max 40, shared small tetrahedron geometry + shared dark emissive-edged material, THREE.InstancedMesh preferred; simple gravity vel.y -= 9.8*dt*2, random tumble via per-instance rotation matrix update, life 1.6s fade-by-scale); emit 6-10 on saucer killShot with radial velocities 8-26 m/s; one shared material, zero per-frame allocation, respects I5/I6" ref=flight-sim3.html:8014-8033#"emitCluster",flight-sim3.html:17094#"function createSaucerTargetModel" dep=-
FIND F15 sev=M tag=bug at=flight-sim3.html:3193-3194#"float foamBand = (1.0 - smoothstep(waterLevel + 0.5" what="user-visible foam striping: on near-flat terrain at grazing angles the height-band foam covers wide areas and its noise reads as horizontal stripes (watch-item from R3 verify)" fix="constrain foam to true shorelines: multiply foamBand by (1) slope proximity — use existing flatness/normal to require the band be spatially narrow: fade by band position pow so only the bottom 2-3m is strong; (2) distance fade dist>1200 -> 0 (shoreline detail only, kills grazing-angle far stripes); (3) larger-scale vnoise break-up mask (uv*0.05) so long bands read patchy not striped; apply identically in SAND_FS and LOWPOLY_FS" ref=flight-sim3.html:3244#"uniform float waterLevel",flight-sim3.html:3199-3203#"float fogF" dep=-
